            flammability: 0.1, appearance: (foliage: "#4a7a3a", flower: "#f4f2ea", sprite: Clump),
            realms: ["Nearctic", "Palearctic"],
            notes: "Leaves like arrowheads standing out of the shallows, white flowers in threes; its tubers in the mud, the wapato, were trodden loose by women wading and roasted like potatoes.",
        ),
        (
