            flammability: 0.1, appearance: (foliage: "#4a7a3a", flower: "#f0d030", sprite: Clump),
            realms: ["Palearctic"],
            notes: "Sword leaves and yellow flags at the edges of ponds and ditches; the rhizome is poisonous, and boiled with iron makes a black ink.",
